    <string name="whats_new_title">What\'s new in v%1$s</string>
    <string-array name="whats_new_items">
        <item>Unreal Engine games: hot TLS and clock reads run inside the game code instead of calling the emulator each time.</item>
        <item>The game clock (RDTSC) now matches the frequency games are told, and shaders can read the real GPU clock.</item>
        <item>First fiber (sceFiber) support on ARM: games that use them used to close the emulator at startup.</item>
        <item>Final Fantasy VII Rebirth and Mewgenics: functions they need are now available.</item>
        <item>Very large GPU compute dispatches are split to fit Adreno limits (Astro Bot).</item>
        <item>New JPEG decoder and encoder libraries, and more fixes from KytyPS5.</item>
        <item>Early groundwork for PS4 games: they appear tagged as PS4 but cannot be played yet.</item>
    </string-array>
